## CRUD 📝

- Create
- Read
- Update
- Delete

## Two Types of Database in Computer Systems 💻

- **Relational Database (SQL)** 🗒
    - Each table has columns and rows.
    - A unique key identifies each row.
- **Non-Relational (NoSQL / No Just SQL)** 🚀
    - Key-value stores
    - Document (JSON, XML, etc.)
    - Graphs
    - Flexible Tables 📊